; 闲鱼 QuanX 测试 (rewrites) — converted from Egern/goofish.yaml (rules 2, rewrites 31, scriptings 1 / Script/goofish.js 7 branches)
; Filter rules live in quanx-goofish-filter.snippet (filters cannot live in a rewrite snippet).
; AND rule: source is url_regex (^http://.+/amdc/mobileDispatch) + user_agent (%E9%97%B2%E9%B1%BC* = 闲鱼*) -> REJECT.
; QuanX filter syntax has no AND rule, but the documented url-and-header rewrite type
; (sample-1.9.0-inapp.conf) matches URL regex AND header-string regex, so it is used here to
; preserve the AND semantics (glob trailing * dropped: the header regex is unanchored).
; If a plain url reject is preferred instead, swap the amdc line for the commented one below it
; (note: that broadens the rule to ALL amdc/mobileDispatch requests regardless of user-agent).
; All body work (18 response_jq entries + the Egern script's 7 branches, my.adapter merged once)
; runs through ONE script-response-body script: quanx-goofish.js.
hostname = acs.m.goofish.com, g-acs.m.goofish.com
^http://.+/amdc/mobileDispatch \r\nUser-Agent:[^\r\n]*%E9%97%B2%E9%B1%BC url-and-header reject
;^http://.+/amdc/mobileDispatch url reject
(?i)^https://acs\.m\.goofish\.com/gw/mtop\.taobao\.idlecommerce\.splash\.ads/ url reject-dict
